  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut potato, carrot and capsicum into <br>bite-sized chunks. <br>• Place prepped veggies on a lined oven tray. <br>Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with chermoula <br>spice blend and season with a pinch of pepper. <br>Toss to coat. <br>• Roast until tender, 25-30 minutes. Set aside to <br>cool slightly.<br>TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggies <br>between two trays.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-cad2fe00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice cucumber <br>(see ingredients) into half-moons. <br>• In a medium bowl, combine the vinegar and a <br>good pinch of sugar and salt. <br>• Add cucumber to pickling liquid. Add just <br>enough water to cover the cucumber. Set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-35734810.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, <br>use your hands to break each spinach falafel<br>into quarters (don’t worry if they crumble!). <br>• In a large frying pan, heat some olive oil<br>(1/4 cup for 2 people/ 1/2 cup for 4 people) over <br>medium-high heat. When oil is hot, cook <br>falafel pieces, tossing, until deep golden brown, <br>4-6 minutes. <br>• Season generously with salt and pepper, then <br>transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-ded10720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, <br>dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise and a splash of the <br>pickling liquid. Season to taste. Set aside. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-314a9c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain pickled cucumber. <br>• Transfer the slightly cooled roasted veggies<br>to a bowl. <br>• Add spinach &amp; rocket mix (see ingredients),<br>rocket leaves and pickled cucumber. Drizzle <br>with a little olive oil. Gently toss to combine. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-121fc340.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide chermoula roast veggie toss between <br>bowls. Top with falafel, some herby yoghurt and <br>crumbled fetta cubes. <br>• Sprinkle over flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67feecb7bf4d5de43bbefc0c/step-ca004950.jpg"
    }
  ]
